exports[`QLD onboarding lots > the lots step 1`] = `"<div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Lots and Owners</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-5">Enter every lot with its contribution schedule lot entitlement and interest schedule lot entitlement, and each owner&#x27;s name exactly as it appears on the strata roll (for example joint owners, or a company with its ACN).</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Lots: 4 entered of 4 on the building</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-turquoise/30 bg-mint-soft/50 text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-px font-bold">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Passes:</span><span>Contribution schedule lot entitlement: 110 entered of 110 total</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mb-5">Interest Schedule Lot Entitlement: From the interest schedule in the community management statement. A whole number, not 0.</p><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line"><table class="w-full min-w-[640px] text-sm"><thead><tr class="bg-muted/50 text-left"><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-24">Lot</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-24">Unit No.</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-32">Contribution Schedule Lot Entitlement</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted w-32">Interest Schedule Lot Entitlement</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-ink-muted">Owner name (as on the strata roll)</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 w-12"><span class="sr-only">Remove</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-line/60 align-top"><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Lot number, row 1" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value="1"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Unit number, row 1" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value=""/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Contribution schedule lot entitlement, row 1" inputMode="numeric" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums" value="40"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Interest schedule lot entitlement, row 1" inputMode="numeric" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums" value="45"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Owner name as on the strata roll, row 1" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" maxLength="500" value="A"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right"><button type="button" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-ink-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-ink" aria-label="Remove row 1">×</button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-line/60 align-top"><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Lot number, row 2" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value="2"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Unit number, row 2" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" value="4"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Contribution schedule lot entitlement, row 2" inputMode="numeric" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums" value="60"/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Interest schedule lot entitlement, row 2" inputMode="numeric" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums" value=""/></td><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Owner name as on the strata roll, row 2" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise" maxLength="500" value="B"/><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-red-600">Enter the interest schedule lot entitlement.</p></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right"><button type="button" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-ink-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-ink" aria-label="Remove row 2">×</button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-line/60 align-top"><td class="px-3 py-2"><input aria-label="Lot number, row 3" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise f